  "description": "A robust, high-performance AMQP 1.0 messaging client designed for seamless enterprise integration.\n\nCodersRealm.NmsAmqpClient simplifies message broker connectivity by offering a unified API that fully supports major industry message brokers, including Apache ActiveMQ, ActiveMQ Artemis, Azure Service Bus, and RabbitMQ (via AMQP 1.0).\n\nKey Features:\n- Universal AMQP 1.0 compatibility across cloud and on-premise environments.\n- Fully production-tested with Apache ActiveMQ, Artemis, RabbitMQ, and Azure Service Bus.\n- Optimized connection pooling, automatic reconnection logic, and robust session management.\n- Streamlined API designed to reduce boilerplate messaging code in modern .NET applications.\n\nPerfect for building scalable, decoupled event-driven architectures and microservices. Fully compatible with .NET 8.0 and .NET 10.0+ environments.",
